    "Fans" : {

    },
    "Fans stay at their lowest speed up to the first point and reach full speed at the second, following the hottest of the CPU, GPU, battery, SSD, Wi-Fi and airflow sensors. The CPU and GPU count as the chip temperature macOS itself steers by, averaged over half a minute, so a few seconds of load do not make the fans roar." : {

